  "ruleText": "Env-Hw 104.37 “Prompt scrap metal” means “prompt scrap metal” as defined in 40 CFR 261.1(c)(12), as reprinted in Appendix D.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 and Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Env-Hw 100) #12343, eff 8-14-17; (formerly Env-Hw 104.32, renumbered by #12920) (See Revision Note #3 at chapter heading for Env-Hw 100); (formerly Env-Hw 104.33, renumbered by #13405) (See Revision Note #4 at chapter heading for Env-Hw 100) (formerly Env-Hw 104.36)",
